The remaining global obligation is to use **global minimality and the full source
population** to construct a same-cardinality strict diameter competitor that may
reduce convex position and change hull membership. A local, KKT, fixed-radius,
Möbius, or convex-position-preserving argument is not a substitute for that bridge.
Promotion recommendation: retain as an unreviewed proof candidate pending independent
scope and proof audit. No existing theorem is promoted or rejected by this report.
